        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSH44U32D, 4\" x 4\" x Square Corners Stainless Steel Spring Hinge, Zigzag Holes </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with One (1) single action stainless steel spring door hinge, tension adjusting allen wrench, adjusting pin, locking pin, plus stainless steel #10 x 1\" wood  screws and #10-24 x 1/2\" machine screws.  Utilizes Zigzag Hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSH44U32D_size.gif?v=1704354772\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSH44U32D Stainless Steel Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Allen Wrench Tool is use to adjust spring tension. The Locking Pin holds the Spring in tension after it is set to the desired closing force. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply  to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-x-4-x-square-corners-spring-hinge-zigzag-hole-deltana-dsh44\"><b>4\" x 4\" Steel Spring Hinge</b></a> in other finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DSH44U32D Stainless Steel Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.097\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Zigzag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Certified: R19063 UL Listed Door Closer Body 57YM</li>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSH44U32D.pdf?v=1704262267\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSH44U32D Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/spring-hinge-install.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana Spring Hinge Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.  (One (1) spring door hinge)</b>\r\n</p>",
